WEBVTT

NOTE
Audio description for Final Fantasy VIII - Disc 2
File: disc02_22h.avi
Scene: The Ragnarok ramming or docking with the Lunatic Pandora
Duration: approximately 6 seconds
Describes the violent impact as the spacecraft breaches the crystal structure.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
The Ragnarok accelerates toward the Lunatic Pandora's exterior, filling the entire viewport with jagged purple crystal.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Impact. The spacecraft crashes through the crystal surface with tremendous force. The interior of the cockpit shakes violently. Alarms shriek.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
The Ragnarok has breached the Lunatic Pandora. The assault has begun. Squall and the team are now deep inside the ancient weapon, committed to the final battle.